                    ("p", "Write the question so that two students would code the answer the same way. 'Do you like the canteen and is it cheap?' is two questions, and a yes is meaningless. 'How many days last week did you buy lunch in the canteen?' has a number for an answer. Avoid a sample that is only your own friends if the claim is about the whole college. Say who was left out."),
