                    {"type": "short", "stem": "Rewrite the search 'computers bad for health' so that it is more likely to find serious sources. Mention two changes.", "answer": "Search for a precise phrase such as \"screen time\" health, and restrict the site or look for a named organisation. Then check the author and the date of whatever opens."},
